<title>POLAND: PPABank Q3 net profit up to PLN 2.8 mln.</title>
<headline>PPABank Q3 net profit up to PLN 2.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piewszy Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA, results for the third quarter endding September 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					     Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>   operating profit			4.60   vs   1.96</p>
<p>   pre-tax profit			  4.60   vs   1.96</p>
<p>   net profit				2.80   vs   1.05</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Pierwszy Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA. @</p>
<p>   loss on financial operations	0.21   vs   0.15</p>
<p>   revenues from securities	    0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>   revenues from commission	    3.14   vs   1.73</p>
<p>   interest and similar revenues    14.91   vs   8.62</p>
<p>   interest and similar costs	  7.30   vs   4.88</p>
<p>   costs of commission		   0.30   vs   0.56</p>
<p>   extraordinary			   0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
